# Technology Stack: InnoGen Autonomous Research Engine

## 1. Frontend Layer
- **Language**: Modern ES6+ JavaScript & HTML5
- **Styling**: Vanilla CSS3 (Obsidian Dark Research Workspace design system, CSS Variables, CSS Grid/Flexbox).
- **Fonts**: Google Fonts (`Plus Jakarta Sans` & `JetBrains Mono`).
- **Graph Visualizer**: Interactive SVG & HTML5 Canvas graph execution map.
- **Build Tool**: Vite hot module reloading.

## 2. Backend & API Services
- **Runtime**: Node.js (ES Modules) & Express.js.
- **API Standards**: RESTful endpoints (`/api/v1/research/...`) & WebSocket Server (`/ws/agent`).
- **Database**: SQLite (local) / PostgreSQL with Prisma ORM.
- **Agent Workflow Engine**: LangGraph StateGraph multi-agent execution pipeline.

## 3. External API & Integration Layer
- **Search Provider**: Tavily Search API / HTTP Web Retrieval Service.
- **LLM Provider**: Google Gemini API / OpenAI API client.
- **Secret Management**: Environment variables via `.env`.
